    "title": "Craft Guys: Stumble Run",
    "description": "Ready to take some nosedive falls, run, jump and hop to the finish line. Get the prize, meet the girl, earn her love and so much more rewards are waiting to honour your victory. \r\nHere you may find yourself struggle to win, try not to fall, keep on running from dusk till dawn, watch your slippy steps, and be aware of crazy obstacles ahead.\r\n \r\n\u2605 Game features:\r\n- Over 100 levels with varying difficulty to conquer.\r\n- Huge collection of creative challenges. \r\n- Discover new 3D scenarios and landscapes with each level.\r\n- Various skins to upgrade.\r\n- Awesome 3D pixelate graphics, sound and animation.\r\n\r\n\u2605 How to play:\r\n- Use buttons/joysticks to move, run and jump.\r\n- Overcome the obstacles, watch out for wipeout hits or you may fall.\r\n- Keep running, earn the coins, prizes and unlock valuable rewards in the end.\r\n- 2 perspectives available: 1st person and 3rd person\r\n- Drag on the screen to find the best angle and explore the breathtaking landscapes.\r\n\r\nTry not to stumble, let's see how far your Craft Guys can get! Get Craft Guys: Stumble Run now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Ready to take some nosedive falls, run, jump and hop to the finish line. Get the prize, meet the girl, earn her love and so much more rewards are waiting to honour your victory. <br>Here you may find yourself struggle to win, try not to fall, keep on running from dusk till dawn, watch your slippy steps, and be aware of crazy obstacles ahead.<br> <br>\u2605 Game features:<br>- Over 100 levels with varying difficulty to conquer.<br>- Huge collection of creative challenges. <br>- Discover new 3D scenarios and landscapes with each level.<br>- Various skins to upgrade.<br>- Awesome 3D pixelate graphics, sound and animation.<br><br>\u2605 How to play:<br>- Use buttons/joysticks to move, run and jump.<br>- Overcome the obstacles, watch out for wipeout hits or you may fall.<br>- Keep running, earn the coins, prizes and unlock valuable rewards in the end.<br>- 2 perspectives available: 1st person and 3rd person<br>- Drag on the screen to find the best angle and explore the breathtaking landscapes.<br><br>Try not to stumble, let&#39;s see how far your Craft Guys can get! Get Craft Guys: Stumble Run now!",
